+    /**
+     * Local, in-memory cache of previously-built manga pager flows, keyed by the listing's query
+     * and filters, so that repeating an identical search/listing shortly after (e.g. navigating
+     * back to this screen) reuses the already-fetched results instead of hitting the network
+     * again. Entries are cleared after [SEARCH_CACHE_TTL_MILLIS] so results don't stay stale
+     * forever.
+     */
